        <div id="fuel-costs" class="scroll-mt-24">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            6. What Each Fuel Actually Costs to Run
          </h2>

          <p>
            Runtime is the main reason to choose natural gas, but cost per hour is a genuine secondary factor over a multi-day outage, and the three fuels are further apart than most owners realise.
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl my-8">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
              <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
