                That is exactly why tri-fuel is more useful than a natural-gas-only generator. Earthquakes, severe storms, and infrastructure damage can interrupt gas service, and utilities sometimes shut it off preemptively in disaster areas. Keep two or three propane tanks on hand as backup so a gas interruption does not leave you without power.
